[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="MailMessage" format=3]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/mail/mail_message.gd" id="script"]

[resource]
script = ExtResource("script")
sender_name = "TinySoft Recruiting"
sender_address = "careers@tinysoft.oc"
subject = "Your QA test assignment — TinySoft"
body = "Hello,

Thank you for applying for the [b]QA Tester (Remote)[/b] position at TinySoft. Before we make a decision, we ask every candidate to complete a short test assignment.

[b]Your test environment:[/b] {link}

The link opens a private test build of our online store together with the DEBUG report window. Your checklist contains [b]{checks} checks[/b], and exactly one of them is broken.

How to report:
• click a check once if the control works as described (green tick);
• click it again if the control is broken (red cross);
• when every check is marked, press SUBMIT.

A fully correct report earns {reward} and an employment offer. An incorrect report ends your application.

Good luck,
Hiring Team
TinySoft Inc."
